          "candidate_block": 5,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 13.641,
          "text": "Article 2 The projects referred to in these Measures are those undertaken through\ndirect commission or bidding, including consulting, survey, design, supervision,\nEPC, and other types of company business operations."
