          "source_block": 10,
          "candidate_block": 6,
          "candidate_line_count": 10,
          "center_error": 13.395,
          "text": "Article 3 The work of business undertaking shall, in principle, follow the\nprocedure of first conducting project evaluation, then applying for approval, and\nfinally signing the contract. Article 4 When carrying out project business\nundertaking work, factors such as the company's development strategy,\nArticle 4 business direction, responsibility cost, production and technical\ncapabilities, and current status shall be comprehensively considered.\nAccording to the process regulations of these Measures, complete the work\nstages including \"information tracking, project evaluation and application, bid\ndocument preparation and review, contract negotiation, contract review and\nsigning, owner service during project implementation, and project follow­up.\""
